{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 44, :comments ["<b>I am Pharaoh.</b> I alone issue authority — from under your jurisdiction, as I said, 'only the throne shall I be greater than you' — but all is under your authority, and without you no person shall have authority to lift his hand to take hold of any weapon, or to lift his leg to mount a horse, in all the land of Egypt, without your permission. And this is the opinion of Onkelos."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:19:33.338545325Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}